    LLM: "Prioritize reaching the initial meld threshold (40/51 points) as quickly as possible. Use high-value cards (Aces, Face cards) to meet this requirement efficiently.\n\nJoker Management: Hold Jokers until you can use them in a meldâ€”15 penalty points is severe. Watch for opportunities to exchange for Jokers on the table. Track which cards have been discarded to calculate drawing odds.\n\nDefensive Discarding: Avoid discarding cards that could help opponents complete their initial meld or extend their existing melds. The 'Late Meld' strategy: Hold back small melds to prevent opponents from building on them. Calculate exactly when to 'call up' based on opponent hand sizes.",
